Mitsuki?

00:16:02.380 --> 00:16:04.860
Ah! Funbags! What are you...

00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:09.860
I... I went into the wrong bath!

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:11.780
No, wait! Mitsuki!?

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:15.260
Sorry, Yuki-nee. Are you all right?

00:16:15.260 --> 00:16:16.370
Uh, yeah.

00:16:16.730 --> 00:16:20.620
It really looks like she's got the
wrong idea. I'm going after her!

00:16:26.720 --> 00:16:29.270
You're such a bonehead.

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:33.760
So I guess they really are-

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:38.580
It's obvious Miss Funbags has hooked him using her seductive tricks!

00:16:38.580 --> 00:16:40.760
How's running away going to solve anything?

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:45.100
If I let you throw a tantrum,
it would have been a huge mess!

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:46.770
If we do things your way,

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:50.290
we'll have another crisis on our hands.

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:52.940
You may be right, but...

00:16:52.940 --> 00:16:53.970
Mitsuki!

00:16:54.830 --> 00:16:56.640
It's not what you think! It's not!

00:16:56.640 --> 00:16:58.200
You have the wrong idea!

00:16:59.650 --> 00:17:02.700
Hey! Hear me out!

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:05.910
She lost her balance and fell, that's all!

00:17:05.910 --> 00:17:06.460
Look.

00:17:06.980 --> 00:17:13.970
Whatever you and Yukina-san do in the bath has absolutely... nothing to do with me.

00:17:14.960 --> 00:17:17.800
Wow, she's even more pissed off.

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:19.650
Mitsuki, you idiot!

00:17:19.650 --> 00:17:23.790
That attitude is only going
to make the heart gauge...

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:26.600
See? What did I tell you?

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:29.050
What's wrong? Are you feeling sick or...

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:35.490
Yep, she's still wearing those freaky panties.

00:17:35.890 --> 00:17:38.010
Hey, you should rest in your room

00:17:38.010 --> 00:17:39.050
I'll carry you.

00:17:39.050 --> 00:17:39.450
No.

00:17:39.900 --> 00:17:42.160
Don't touch me with your dirty hands.

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:44.540
I didn't do anything dirty!

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:47.040
But you and Yukina-san were going at it!

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:51.580
Nothing happened! Why am I the bad guy?!

00:17:52.440 --> 00:17:56.380
Heck, you were forced to take me in as your sister.

00:17:57.130 --> 00:18:01.350
And I'm not nice to you like
a certain older girl anyway.

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:05.770
Wait, are you telling me...

00:18:06.510 --> 00:18:09.100
you're jealous of Yuki-nee?

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:12.800
How could I be jealous? That's just dumb!

00:18:12.800 --> 00:18:14.700
I guess it is.

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:16.070
Say, Mitsuki.

00:18:16.640 --> 00:18:21.790
You say you're not nice to me, but aren't you the one making my bentos?

00:18:21.790 --> 00:18:24.910
Believe me, that makes me glad.

00:18:25.780 --> 00:18:26.940
Thanks a lot.

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:28.800
Oh no...

00:18:30.860 --> 00:18:32.380
He's rubbing your head!

00:18:33.310 --> 00:18:37.120
Anyway, it's really not what you think.

00:18:37.740 --> 00:18:40.160
Come on, I'll carry you.

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:41.790
Straighten up a little bit.

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:51.650
He's...

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:53.290
What's wrong, Mitsuki?

00:18:53.290 --> 00:18:54.720
Nothing.

00:18:56.860 --> 00:18:59.820
I'm finally here, Nanami-schwan!

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:03.330
Where are you? Where are you hiding?

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:06.200
Over there?

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:07.660
Nanami-saan!

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:11.500
Dumb Onii?!

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:13.410
What are you doing here?

00:19:13.410 --> 00:19:15.880
Why are <i>you</i> here?! Where's Yuuya-senpai?!

00:19:16.810 --> 00:19:18.320
I don't know!

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:23.510
Don't look, Baldspot!

00:19:24.790 --> 00:19:26.510
I'm not balding!

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:34.060
This is pretty hard!

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:36.570
There!

00:19:37.770 --> 00:19:42.090
Cheer up already! You ended
up filling the gauge!

00:19:42.090 --> 00:19:44.490
You sure take things in stride.

00:19:45.020 --> 00:19:48.700
Aren't you the least bit suspicious
after seeing those two?

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:51.110
Eh? Yeah, well...

00:19:51.110 --> 00:19:53.880
Onii-chan said nothing happened.

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:56.340
Why wouldn't I trust the man I love?

00:20:04.340 --> 00:20:08.430
Can you really trust someone
that much if you love him?

00:20:09.130 --> 00:20:11.050
It's not something I could do.

00:20:11.050 --> 00:20:14.440
There'd be no trust. All I'd do is doubt.

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:16.050
Mitsuki-chan!

00:20:19.830 --> 00:20:20.990
Do you have a minute?

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:26.830
I'm dead.

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:31.170
So you see, it happened because I fell on him.

00:20:31.170 --> 00:20:34.580
There's absolutely nothing to worry about.

00:20:35.470 --> 00:20:38.170
I wasn't actually worried about anything!

00:20:38.830 --> 00:20:44.450
He's just... some guy who
acts like my older brother!

00:20:45.560 --> 00:20:47.020
Come here! Hug!

00:20:47.020 --> 00:20:48.850
What are you doing?

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:50.940
I can see right through you.

00:20:50.940 --> 00:20:52.230
You're so adorable!

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:55.530
With such an adorable little sister to look after,

00:20:55.530 --> 00:20:58.690
Yuu-kun has no choice but to act more responsible.

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:01.230
Huh? What are you...

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:12.580
Mitsuki-chan.

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:15.080
I <i>will</i> come out on top.

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:18.080
Bye. Sleep tight.

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:21.700
That's <i>my</i> dorayaki...

00:21:24.590 --> 00:21:28.130
You see that? She officially declared war on us!

00:21:28.130 --> 00:21:30.000
D-Dorayaki...

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:31.010
I know!

00:21:31.010 --> 00:21:33.410
You think so too, right?

00:21:33.410 --> 00:21:35.060
I wanted to eat it.

00:21:35.060 --> 00:21:36.260
What?

00:21:38.330 --> 00:21:42.280
You're getting too carried away, Yukina-senpai.

00:21:43.160 --> 00:21:46.770
I think it's time to rock his boat a little.

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:53.810
Please hug me tight.

00:21:53.810 --> 00:21:56.410
The man of my dreams with the charming do.

00:21:56.410 --> 00:21:59.290
Come closer to me.

00:21:59.290 --> 00:22:02.170
Let’s make things more exciting.

00:22:13.270 --> 00:22:15.490
I want you to notice

00:22:15.490 --> 00:22:18.730
how much I feel like flailing about.

00:22:18.730 --> 00:22:21.030
I’ll gather up whatever courage I have

00:22:21.030 --> 00:22:24.190
and go full throttle towards you.

00:22:24.190 --> 00:22:26.560
Whenever a girl gets serious,

00:22:26.560 --> 00:22:29.780
you can’t imagine how far she’ll go.

00:22:29.780 --> 00:22:32.040
Raise the readings of my heart-shaped gauge

00:22:32.040 --> 00:22:35.120
and take me beyond the clouds.

00:22:35.120 --> 00:22:37.750
These ordinary days

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:40.630
are something special to me.

00:22:40.630 --> 00:22:46.130
They’re like miracles covered in light.

00:22:46.130 --> 00:22:51.850
If I don’t act now, my feelings will stay bottled up.

00:22:51.850 --> 00:22:57.270
It's painful regretting what could have been.

00:22:57.270 --> 00:22:59.980
You’re my man with the charming do

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:02.760
who makes my heart throb like no one else.

00:23:02.760 --> 00:23:05.470
Well you see, that’s because

00:23:05.470 --> 00:23:08.490
I love you very much.

00:23:08.490 --> 00:23:11.030
You make my heart race whenever I’m with you.

00:23:11.030 --> 00:23:13.700
But your charming do makes me stronger.

00:23:13.700 --> 00:23:16.570
I want to keep on loving you

00:23:16.570 --> 00:23:19.200
always and forever more.

00:23:20.420 --> 00:23:23.960
Next time on <i>Recently,
My Sister Is Unusual!</i>

00:23:23.960 --> 00:23:25.880
I want to see
Senpai sleeping!

00:23:25.880 --> 00:23:27.260
What the hell
are you doing?!

00:23:27.260 --> 00:23:30.010
Yuu-kun might be left feeling estranged.

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:32.890
Onii-chan only needs
us to keep him company!

00:23:32.890 --> 00:23:35.510
I can't believe Senpai would do that!

00:23:35.510 --> 00:23:38.020
Yeah, I'm totally
feeling her up again.

00:23:38.020 --> 00:23:39.970
Nooo!
